Assignment: Lab 10

This assignment is about implementation of TAC to arithmentic , boolean expressions also modifying symbol table to declare varaibles and identify already declared variable.
This assignment is an extention of lab 8 and lab 9 with addtion of if , if-else , boolean and while loop using short cicuit evaluation and backpatching and added function invocation.

While doing this i encouter classical danglng if else case , which is not resolved yet, so sample test case do not contain if else.

To execute:

bash:
lex lex.l
yacc -d yacc.y
gcc lex.yy.c y.tab.c symbol.c -o parser
./parser

check test case in sample.txt , to execute :
./parser < input.txt